 Aria `Group`."],[418,"**`FieldInput`** — the single-line control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `Input` given antares spacing via `Box`)."],[416,"**`FieldLabel`** — names the field and flags whether it's required (wraps React Aria `Label`, rendering an optional `*` indicator)."],[419,"**`FieldTextArea`** — the multiline control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `TextArea` given antares spacing via `Box`)."],[421,"**`FieldTrigger`** — a full-width value-display button inside the box that opens an overlay (used by Select and DatePicker): a value area plus a trailing icon, laid out across the group. `variant=\"select\"` is transparent and input-like; `variant=\"control\"` is a filled segment inside a shared group."],[516,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[515,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[523,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[524,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[522,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[866,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[503,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[1319,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[508,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1143,"**Adornments**: Optional `leadingText` and `trailingText` for fixed text before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`)"],[903,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[664,"**Arrow Down/Up**: Navigate throug